  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Different Memories, Shared Futures: Towards Inclusive Memorialisation (Regional) - ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is based on the understanding that existing memorialisation practices in the Western Balkans are often fragmented, exclusive/mono-ethnic, and politically instrumentalized, which limits their contribution to reconciliation. This project will address this by supporting community-led efforts and build their capacity towards more inclusive and creative forms of memorialisation that foster shared remembrance and contribute to reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
